{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17514","headline":"县君赴兴庆宫朝贺载之奉行册礼因书即事 · 权德舆","name":"县君赴兴庆宫朝贺载之奉行册礼因书即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合卺交欢二十年，今朝比翼共朝天。\n风传漏刻香车度，日照旌旗彩仗鲜。\n顾我华簪鸣玉佩，看君盛服耀金钿。\n相期偕老宜家处，鹤发鱼轩更可怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}